{"unit_id":"09aea6ef998ff3859b41","title":"提案五","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b1","raw_text":"提案五 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[36.0,47.216041564941406,92.0040054321289,63.17604064941406]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b2","raw_text":"案由：處方安眠藥的審查仍以健保署藥品給付規定為依歸，並以單ㄧ用藥為 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":35,"bbox":[36.0,77.23600006103516,567.4199829101562,93.19599914550781]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b3","raw_text":"     原則，若需併用兩種以上(含)需有具體詳實的理由，提請討論。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":36,"bbox":[36.0,107.23600006103516,532.0199584960938,123.19599914550781]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b4","raw_text":"說明: 1.非精神科醫師、神經科專科醫師若需開立本類藥品，每日不宜超過 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":37,"bbox":[36.0,137.23599243164062,567.4199829101562,153.1959991455078]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b5","raw_text":"        一顆，連續治療期間不宜超過6 個月。若因病情需長期使用，病歷 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[36.0,167.23599243164062,567.4199829101562,183.1959991455078]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b6","raw_text":"        應載明原因。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":16,"bbox":[36.0,197.23599243164062,203.989990234375,213.1959991455078]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b7","raw_text":"     2. 精神科、神經科專科醫師應針對必須連續使用本藥的個案，提出合 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":39,"bbox":[36.0,227.23599243164062,567.4199829101562,243.1959991455078]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b8","raw_text":"        理的診斷，並在病歷上詳細記錄，除藥品仿單規定每日不得超過ㄧ \n","start_char":0,"end_char":39,"bbox":[36.0,257.2660217285156,567.4199829101562,273.22601318359375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b9","raw_text":"        顆者，其餘每日至多二顆，且不宜長期處方。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":30,"bbox":[36.0,287.2660217285156,427.96002197265625,303.22601318359375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b10","raw_text":"     3. 依一般使用指引不建議各種安眠藥併用，應依睡眠障礙型態處方安 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":39,"bbox":[36.0,317.2660217285156,567.4199829101562,333.22601318359375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b11","raw_text":"        眠藥，若需不同半衰期之藥物併用應有明確之睡眠障礙型態描述紀 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":39,"bbox":[36.0,347.2660217285156,567.4199829101562,363.22601318359375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b12","raw_text":"        錄，且應在合理劑量範圍內。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":23,"bbox":[36.0,377.2660217285156,315.9700012207031,393.22601318359375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b13","raw_text":"     4. 對於首次就診或六個月內未曾處方安眠藥之病患，限處方7 日內之 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[36.0,407.2660217285156,567.4199829101562,423.22601318359375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b14","raw_text":"        安眠藥管制藥品。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":18,"bbox":[36.0,437.2860107421875,236.02999877929688,453.2460021972656]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b15","raw_text":"決議：通過，同說明段。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":13,"bbox":[36.0,466.2060241699219,219.9499969482422,482.166015625]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b16","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,502.2060241699219,43.97999954223633,518.166015625]}],"source_quality":[]}